            "notes": "Checks the service processes of every node of a Huawei OceanStor Pacific storage system via the REST API (/cluster_service/service_processes endpoint). Alerts when a process is not running, and when a node of the cluster does not report its processes at all. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy and shorter output via --brief.",
